<div class="text text__white">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-7a8bbce8a4&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-02-26T18:57:47Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>You’ve seen the awards, now get the story. Here’s what sets Druva apart and keeps the analysts talking.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-7a8bbce8a4" class="cmp-text">
