<div id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f" class="cmp-accordion" data-cmp-is="accordion" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-standard-0d45238e5f&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[&#34;accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-24683e903e&#34;],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/accordion-standard&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-03-04T23:01:26Z&#34;}}" data-cmp-single-expansion data-placeholder-text="false">
    <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-24683e903e&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/accordion-standard/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;What does Druva do?&#34;}}" id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-24683e903e" data-cmp-expanded>
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-24683e903e-button" class="cmp-accordion__button cmp-accordion__button--expanded" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-24683e903e-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">What does Druva do?</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-24683e903e-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--expanded" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-24683e903e-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">

    
    <div id="container-24683e903e" class="cmp-container">
        
        


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text text__white aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-e1c33ad6c9&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-03-04T23:01:48Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Druva is a fully managed, cloud-native SaaS platform for data security, backup, and cyber resilience built to protect data across cloud workloads, SaaS apps, endpoints, and more without the hardware and overhead of legacy backup.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-e1c33ad6c9" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Druva is a fully managed, cloud-native SaaS platform for data security, backup, and cyber resilience built to protect data across cloud workloads, SaaS apps, endpoints, and more without the hardware and overhead of legacy backup.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>

    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-6370c78258&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/accordion-standard/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Why did Gartner recognize Druva in the 2025 Gartner® Magic Quadrant™ for Backup and Data Protection Platforms?&#34;}}" id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-6370c78258">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-6370c78258-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-6370c78258-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Why did Gartner recognize Druva in the 2025 Gartner® Magic Quadrant™ for Backup and Data Protection Platforms?</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-6370c78258-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-6370c78258-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">

    
    <div id="container-6370c78258" class="cmp-container">
        
        


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text text__white aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-92414f9a10&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-03-04T23:02:06Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Druva was recognized as a Leader in the 2025 Gartner Magic Quadrant for Backup and Data Protection Platforms, reflecting market validation for modern, cloud-first backup and recovery approaches as enterprises move more critical workloads to the cloud.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-92414f9a10" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Druva was recognized as a Leader in the 2025 Gartner Magic Quadrant for Backup and Data Protection Platforms, reflecting market validation for modern, cloud-first backup and recovery approaches as enterprises move more critical workloads to the cloud.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>

    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-4089fad9fd&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/accordion-standard/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-04-13T06:18:59Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;What does it mean that Druva is a Leader in the 2025 IDC MarketScape for Cyber-Recovery?&#34;}}" id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-4089fad9fd">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-4089fad9fd-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-4089fad9fd-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">What does it mean that Druva is a Leader in the 2025 IDC MarketScape for Cyber-Recovery?</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-4089fad9fd-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-4089fad9fd-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">

    
    <div id="container-4089fad9fd" class="cmp-container">
        
        


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text text__white aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-a7f2045af6&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-03-04T23:02:25Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>IDC’s Cyber-Recovery assessment focuses on how vendors help organizations recover quickly and confidently as cyber threats evolve. Druva being named a Leader signals strong alignment to modern cyber-recovery needs, protecting data while simplifying operations and accelerating the return to business continuity.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-a7f2045af6" class="cmp-text">
    <p>IDC’s Cyber-Recovery assessment focuses on how vendors help organizations recover quickly and confidently as cyber threats evolve. Druva being named a Leader signals strong alignment to modern cyber-recovery needs, protecting data while simplifying operations and accelerating the return to business continuity.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>

    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-4da72ce418&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/accordion-standard/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;What is the 2025 GigaOm Cloud Data Protection Radar Report, and why does it matter?&#34;}}" id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-4da72ce418">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-4da72ce418-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-4da72ce418-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">What is the 2025 GigaOm Cloud Data Protection Radar Report, and why does it matter?</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-4da72ce418-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-4da72ce418-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">

    
    
    
    <div id="container-4da72ce418" class="cmp-container">
        
        
        <div class="text text__white">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-1e2ee9c1db&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-03-04T23:02:53Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>The GigaOm Radar evaluates cloud data protection vendors on capability and momentum. In the 2025 report, Druva was positioned as a Leader &amp;amp; Outperformer, highlighting the advantages of a 100% SaaS architecture and innovation in cyber resilience and cloud data protection.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-1e2ee9c1db" class="cmp-text">
    <p>The GigaOm Radar evaluates cloud data protection vendors on capability and momentum. In the 2025 report, Druva was positioned as a Leader &amp; Outperformer, highlighting the advantages of a 100% SaaS architecture and innovation in cyber resilience and cloud data protection.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

        
    </div>

</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-0d058d3399&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/accordion-standard/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Are Druva’s customer awards and review accolades based on real user feedback?&#34;}}" id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-0d058d3399">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-0d058d3399-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-0d058d3399-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Are Druva’s customer awards and review accolades based on real user feedback?</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-0d058d3399-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-standard-0d45238e5f-item-0d058d3399-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">

    
    
    
    <div id="container-0d058d3399" class="cmp-container">
        
        
        <div class="text text__white">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-7318fd7ef1&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-03-04T23:04:04Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Yes. Accolades like Gartner Peer Insights™ Customers’ Choice are based on peer reviews and ratings, reflecting customer sentiment around real-world experience with enterprise backup and recovery solutions.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-7318fd7ef1" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Yes. Accolades like Gartner Peer Insights™ Customers’ Choice are based on peer reviews and ratings, reflecting customer sentiment around real-world experience with enterprise backup and recovery solutions.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

        
    </div>

</div>
</div>
    </div>
